| `scripts/desktop.mjs`, `desktop.sh`, `start.sh`, `open.sh`, `stop.sh` | Default desktop startup/quit, source preparation and detached Electron launch |
| `setup-sandbox.sh`, `scripts/install-linux-sandbox.sh` | One-time administrator-authenticated AppArmor user-namespace permission for this checkout's exact Electron binary |
